{"id":307,"flavor":[{"games":["Alpha Sapphire","Sapphire"],"text":"Meditite heightens its inner energy through meditation. It survives on just one berry a day. Minimal eating is another aspect of this Pokémon’s training."},{"games":["Omega Ruby","Ruby"],"text":"Meditite undertakes rigorous mental training deep in the mountains. However, whenever it meditates, this Pokémon always loses its concentration and focus. As a result, its training never ends."},{"games":["Y","Diamond"],"text":"It eats just one berry a day. By enduring hunger, its spirit is tempered and made sharper."},{"games":["X","White 2","Black 2","White","Black","Platinum"],"text":"It always trains deep in mountains. It levitates when it heightens its spiritual power through meditation."},{"games":["SoulSilver","HeartGold"],"text":"It meditates to heighten its inner energy and to float in the air. It eats one berry a day."},{"games":["Pearl"],"text":"It never misses its daily yoga workouts, and it heightens its spiritual power through meditation."},{"games":["LeafGreen","FireRed"],"text":"It never skips its daily yoga training. It heightens its inner strength through meditation."},{"games":["Emerald"],"text":"It continually meditates for hours every day. As a result of rigorous and dedicated yoga training, it has tempered its spiritual power so much it can fly."}],"abilities":[{"name":"Pure Power","hidden":false,"description":"Using its pure power, the Pokémon doubles its Attack stat."},{"name":"Telepathy","hidden":true,"description":"The Pokémon anticipates and dodges the attacks of its allies."}],"eggGroups":["Human-Like"],"genderRate":4,"hatchCounter":20,"baseHappiness":70,"growthRate":"medium","habitat":"mountain","color":"Blue","shape":"Humanoid","evolution":{"id":307,"name":"Meditite","condition":null,"children":[{"id":308,"name":"Medicham","condition":"Lv. 37","children":[]}]},"moves":{"game":"Scarlet / Violet","level":[[1,93],[1,526],[9,197],[12,203],[15,364],[17,395],[20,60],[23,347],[25,428],[